{"id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursive-set.md","title":"Recursive Set (Decidable Set)","display":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set (Decidable Set)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursive-set","aliases":["92-df-recursive-set"],"display":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set (Decidable Set)","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"第 IV 章附录 p. 53（PDF 70）","source_status":"原书关系刻画的本地特征函数版本"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-set — Recursive Set (Decidable Set)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章附录 p. 53（PDF 70）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书关系刻画的本地特征函数版本"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (definition target recursive-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (recursive-function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> (characteristic function of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_A(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_A(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归集 = 可判定集</li>\n<li>特征函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>是全递归函数</li>\n<li>存在算法判定任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>是否属于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>递归集封闭于补、交、并</li>\n<li>递归集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subsetneq\">\\(\\subsetneq\\)</span> 递归可枚举集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Leftrightarrow\">\\(\\Leftrightarrow\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{A}\">\\(\\bar{A}\\)</span>都是r.e.的</li>\n<li>在固定有效文法与标准公理模式下，PA 的公理码集是递归的</li>\n<li>递归可公理化的前提条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书的标准模型定义直接是 A 及其补集都 Σ₁，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a>。本文用全递归特征函数给计算模型版本。特征函数的总性不能只凭一个正的 c.e. 枚举获得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (recursive-function class, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书的标准模型定义直接是 A 及其补集都 Σ₁，见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]。本文用全递归特征函数给计算模型版本。特征函数的总性不能只凭一个正的 c.e. 枚举获得。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\chi_A(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\subsetneq","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{A}","display":false}],"bytes":1513,"backlinks":[{"id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"24d1c4528c1ab822","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\chi_A:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}$ (characteristic function of $A$, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"6c4d7648de3418cf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","cc77d3ecb4f82cf1"]}